# =====================================================================
# Release V127 -- Day Book counts as a Site x Practitioner DIMENSION view
# =====================================================================
# Follow-up to V126. The Day Book action counts + availability live on the GOLD_AGG
# Aggregate_Site_Practitioner_Current, but an Aggregate/fact-role view's column dropped into a
# matrix ROW area groups-by and fans out. Gold.vw_Dim_Site_Practitioner_Current presents them as a
# DIMENSION (same base name as the aggregate it draws from), enriched with the full practitioner
# attribute set + site label, held as TEXT for the Row area. The view generator wraps it into
# PBI.[List Site Practitioner Current] (vw_Dim_ -> a List/dimension view). Grain = site x
# practitioner (1-1 with the aggregate); all practitioners are single-site today so the diary
# matrix relates on fk_Practitioner. MIGRATE drops the interim vw_Dim_Practitioner_Day_Book.
#
# MODEL (user, in Desktop): relate [List Site Practitioner Current].fk Practitioner to the diary
# fact's fk Practitioner (one-to-many), then drop [Full Name] + the count text columns into the
# Day Book diary matrix Rows (Stepped Layout = Off).
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V127__practitioner_day_book_dimension_view.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

MIGRATE  Migrations\V127__rename_day_book_dimension_view.sql
EXEC     EXEC Meta.usp_Create_Gold_Views;

TEST
